<title>USA: Danielson Holding Q3 net loss from profit.</title>
<headline>Danielson Holding Q3 net loss from profit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $0.12	  profit  $0.05</p>
<p> Net loss	  1,838	  profit  868</p>
<p> Revs		11,451		   17,435</p>
<p>	  9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $0.19	  profit  $0.14</p>
<p> Net loss	  2,941	  profit  2,260</p>
<p> Revs		35,759		   59,625</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of company is Danielson Holding Corp.  </p>
<p>The company said 1996 losses were attributed to $1.662 million reserve for the sale of Danielson's trust subsidiary and a one time charge of $1.272 million for payments relating to the deaths of two executives.</p>
